Recommendations

Propagate validation into outcome scoring (highest priority).
Use validation_status or validation_summary.final_signal before scoring trade outcomes. If final signal is BLOCKED/HOLD/WATCH/VALIDATION_UNAVAILABLE, score as non-actionable (HOLD path) instead of LONG/SHORT. This will immediately reduce false losses and align metrics with your validation engine.

Relax or redesign cadence hard-fail logic.
Given observed pattern (all sampled invalid runs had only mismatch=2), move from hard-fail to warning for low mismatch counts, or increase tolerated mismatches for long windows. Keep hard-fail for true integrity defects (OHLC, nulls, duplicates).

Convert VERY_LOW_VOLUME from hard blocker to conditional penalty.
When net edge is strong, penalize score instead of force BLOCKED. Keep hard block only for extreme low liquidity conditions.

Re-tune training for signal quality.
Increase AUTO_FINETUNE_DATASET_LIMIT significantly, run more epochs than 1, and raise learning rate from 1e-6 to a practical finetuning range. Current setup is likely underfitting and not adapting enough.

Reduce inference randomness.
Lower temperature, lower top-p, and/or increase sample-count with aggregation to reduce noisy directional flips.

Align observability with decision logic.
Expose validation_status in signals API rows and dashboard tables, and add alerts on blocker ratios (especially INVALID_5M_INPUT spikes and sustained BLOCKED share).

